'''Confused_Goon''' was an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}} who was elected as a [[Minister Election|Minister]] to {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}}. When he won, he attempted to remove the {{AN|Work Harder}} perk and was sent to the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}. 

While imprisoned, he walked around the cage and sent messages in chat. The player could vote on his freedom by talking to the {{NPCSprite|Judicial Goon}}. Voting against freeing the prisoners granted {{Stat|mf|+5}} for {{Green|2hr}}, and cast votes could be recast upon the effect expiring.

